  "source_extensions": [
    "OriginalEffects optional provider proves exact final runtime slot-array identity and rechecks loaded address against live selected slot",
    "Provider owns explicit caller code lifetime, separate from HostDomain to avoid generic callback-lifetime ownership cycles",
    "Created->Setup controller live-slot loads->Ready sealed10 before foreign activation->Stopped; no reset/reseal",
    "Observed sealed mismatch including zero stops future loads even if value restored; no write/repair/SDK call",
    "Pause stops only after admission pause success and native count0; false or throwing close retains code/binding; successful close retains code until Context destruction",
    "No provider mutex spans original SDK call; bookkeeping preserves LastError",
    "Failed hook create still writes original-output prefix; nonzero sealed metadata does not imply enabled hook or satisfy independent readiness proof",
    "No new per-original-call PTD pre/post checkpoints; explicit engine uninitialize/unload and raw slot concurrency remain external contracts"
  ],
